@startuml selma_machine_interaction
' ============================================================
' Selma — State Machine Interaction Overview
' Source:  C4 component map + docs/state-machine ownership
' Contract: 8.2.4
' Role:    Cross-machine handoff overview (not a lifecycle aggregate)
' ============================================================

title Selma — State Machine Interaction Overview\n<size:12><i>C4 handoffs · primary machines · detail views · no independent 9th aggregate</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

state "Capability Authorization" as Authz #B9770E : **cross-cutting**\ningress · matrix · SoD · stage\nallow | deny + audit
state "Directive Lifecycle" as Dir #2C6E49 : Draft · Active\nDeprecated · Superseded\nfork/merge/split → Draft children
state "Compilation / CG-IR" as Comp #1B7A6E : hermetic gates\nread lock · CAS publish
state "CG-IR Hash Detail" as Hash #1B7A6E : dual-hash · reuse\n(detail of Comp)
state "Inspection Execution" as Insp #1B7A6E : six pure stages\npin · evaluate · report
state "Finding Lifecycle" as Find #3B7DD8 : **normative §3.1**\n10 states · SoD · system close
state "HLC Detail" as Hlc #3B7DD8 : (pt, lc) advance\n(detail of event envelope)
state "Conflict Resolution" as Conf #1B7A6E : cascade · artifact\nbinding vs advisory
state "Architectural Certification" as Cert #B9770E : AA-01..AA-07\nCI/CD only
state "Artifact Lifecycle" as Art #4A4A4A : write-once · CAS\nreplicate · archive

[*] --> Authz : any mutating request
Authz --> Dir : allow · directive.*
Authz --> Insp : allow · inspection.*
Authz --> Find : allow · finding.* / evidence.*
Authz --> Conf : allow · conflict.resolve
Authz --> [*] : deny · DomainUnchanged

Dir --> Comp : publish / identity op\ncompile request
Comp --> Hash : Hash Nodes zoom
Hash --> Comp : snapshot hash ready
Comp --> Art : CgIrPublished
Dir --> Art : directive records

Insp --> Comp : pin cg_ir_snapshot_hash
Insp --> Find : Report births findings\nFindingCreated
Insp --> Art : inspection snapshot + trace
Insp --> Conf : multi-rule fire on frozen CG-IR

Find --> Hlc : every success event
Hlc --> Find : tag logical_clock
Find --> Art : append event_store

Conf --> Art : conflict artifact
Comp --> Conf : compile-time conflict map

Cert --> Art : certification artifact
Cert --> Comp : read CG-IR samples
Cert --> Find : SoD / mediated-feedback tests\n(no production mutation)

Art --> [*] : archived / retained

@enduml
